{"ID":"20260202164417-17f8s7v","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"icon":"1f38d","id":"20260202164417-17f8s7v","tags":"注意力机制,神经网络基础学习","title":"CBAM","type":"doc","updated":"20260202164614"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-k2xavgy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-k2xavgy","updated":"20260202164614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CBAM注意力机制模块他本来的名字是卷积注意力机制模块-Convolutional Block Attention Module，该注意力机制是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Sanghyun Woo"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等人在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2018"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"年在论文"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"CBAM: Convolutional Block Attention Module"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"提出来的。"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-lwwcsgn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-lwwcsgn","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1807.06521","TextMarkTextContent":"CBAM论文地址"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-i5lcs1a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-i5lcs1a","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在就对该算法进行一些解读和自己的理解，我将从原理，公式推导，以及代码结构进行阐述。"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-my1t5aa","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-my1t5aa","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 背景原理"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-r9v9fz7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-r9v9fz7","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在很多的图像处理相关的领域卷积神经网络发挥了极为重要的作用，卷积神经网络以其强大的表征能力，极大的提高了视觉任务的性能。那么卷积神经网络的性能主要研究的三大因素是什么呢？什么是影响卷积神经网络性能的主要因素呢？不难猜到就是下面三个："}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-u4iskvu","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-u4iskvu","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-x4xfjgu","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-x4xfjgu","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-jayf2iz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-jayf2iz","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"深度(depth)：卷积神经网络"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"串联的总体层数"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-us55gp0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-us55gp0","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-35zu8kp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-35zu8kp","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"宽度(width)：卷积神经网络的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"通道个数"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-gtc2p01","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-gtc2p01","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-73psf1s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-73psf1s","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"基数(cardinality)：卷积神经网络的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"分支个数"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-4qkby9s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-4qkby9s","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对于深度这个方面，在之前2016年由何凯明大神提出的ResNet残差连接就已经实现了非常深的网络进行训练；对于宽度这个方面，在之前2015年由google公司提出的GoogleNet网络也已经实现。对于基数这个方面，有更多的人都在进行努力。"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-na5bdon","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-na5bdon","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是除了这上面的几个因素之外，还引入了一个注意力的机制，可以让网络自动调节自己所重要的特征的权重。之前的SE注意力机制主要关注的通道这方面的问题，但是我们是不是可以将通道和空间的注意力机制相互融合以实现一种新的注意力机制模块呢？那么CBAM模块油然而生。"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-kigqg3t","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-kigqg3t","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260202164423-d41j058","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-d41j058","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里就简单的讲一下什么是通道注意力，什么是空间注意力机制吧！"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-wrcpwzl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-wrcpwzl","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大家都知道在深度学习网络过程中，每个过程的图像批量实际上是四个维度的东西，分别是(B-Batch，C-channel，H-hight，W-width)，这四个维度就是每一次输入输出的玩意儿。用大白话来说就是，一箱相册，一个箱子有很多图片册，而每个图片册有很多张图片，每个图片又有长度和宽度。之前我们主要关注的是图片册中每张图片整体的感觉；但是忽略了图片中的一些细节问题。"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-45nd0x7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-45nd0x7","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通道注意力主要就是在-channel也就是C上做操作。空间注意力主要就是在-H和W上面做操作。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-bhyzpmu","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-bhyzpmu","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-fj52rq9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-fj52rq9","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-ip3fvsr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-ip3fvsr","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通道注意力机制：关注"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"是什么"}]}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-z1via3n","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-z1via3n","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-y3e2n4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-y3e2n4v","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空间注意力机制：关注"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"在哪里"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-wret1rw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-wret1rw","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ok那么到现在我们就将"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"通道"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"空间"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"两个维度进行了很好的区分，CBAM的核心思想就是将这两个维度结合起来。"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-xzhkyl4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-xzhkyl4","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是CBAM并没有把它们一股脑混在一起处理，而是采用了串联的方式。"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-ab8nmi4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-ab8nmi4","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这就好比我们找东西的逻辑："}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-trweqwy","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-trweqwy","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-2p8woho","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-2p8woho","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-vpn2n4a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-vpn2n4a","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先想找什么先过通道注意力模块"}]}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-ade5frq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-ade5frq","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-dys0aph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-dys0aph","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再看在哪里再过空间注意力模块"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-cj2jhte","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-cj2jhte","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260114204631853"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/3693258/202601/3693258-20260114204638830-1417680869.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-3yczixj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-3yczixj","updated":"20260202164520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.公式推导"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-2im9bh3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-2im9bh3","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里主要有两组问题，也就是找什么东西和找的东西在哪里这两个问题。只有解决了这两个问题，才能够比较好的实现。"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-ipou2sl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-ipou2sl","updated":"20260202164520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.1.通道注意力"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-nudpqz8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-nudpqz8","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在这里要解决的是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"找什么东西"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的问题，也就是要解决的是那个通道更加的重要一些。"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-aq5lzb3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-aq5lzb3","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在CBAM中，作者认为最大池化(Max Pooling)和平均池化(Average Pooling)包含了不同的信息特征，所以不同于SE-Net只用了平均池化，CBAM决定两个都要用。"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-ntgytet","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-ntgytet","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"具体步骤："}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-1897j5i","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-1897j5i","updated":"20260202164520"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-4mc0wgw","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-4mc0wgw","updated":"20260202164520"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-z568huc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-z568huc","updated":"20260202164505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对输入特征图F分别进行"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全局平均池化"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全局最大池化"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这样就把"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"C \\times H \\times W"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的特征图变成了两个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"C \\times 1 \\times 1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​的向量。"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-hy8rr4c","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-hy8rr4c","updated":"20260202164520"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-ufqwvxd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-ufqwvxd","updated":"20260202164513"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-d8p2po3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-d8p2po3","updated":"20260202164513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"F_{avg}^c"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：平均池化得到的向量。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-gus4q2v","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-gus4q2v","updated":"20260202164520"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-hnv057q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-hnv057q","updated":"20260202164520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"F_{max}^{c}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：最大池化得到的向量。"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-tq43juy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-tq43juy","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-glx9bml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-glx9bml","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"把经过池化后的向量分别放入到一组共享的全连接层MLP。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-tfokb4d","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-tfokb4d","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-oil4bzf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-oil4bzf","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"经过sigmoid函数归一化后和原始输入相乘。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-wl2rge1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-wl2rge1","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260114205225033"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/3693258/202601/3693258-20260114205233458-910657922.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-ymgytik","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-ymgytik","updated":"20260202164601"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2.空间注意力"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-033sp6s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-033sp6s","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解决了看什么，接下来要推导解决看哪里的空间注意力。"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-svfmuro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-svfmuro","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这时候输入的是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"已经经过通道注意力加权后的特征图"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" F'。"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-ks5n25t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-ks5n25t","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"具体步骤："}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-6xpov8a","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-6xpov8a","updated":"20260202164601"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-z8n6f9l","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-z8n6f9l","updated":"20260202164601"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-hy342b1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-hy342b1","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"压缩通道：这次我们要把通道维数压缩，所以在通道维度上分别做平均池化和最大池化。"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-k1iv3e8","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-k1iv3e8","updated":"20260202164601"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-0qm23xn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-0qm23xn","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-a45z6xu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-a45z6xu","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这就好比把厚厚的一叠相册(多个通道)压扁，看透视图。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-2a3d7sc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-2a3d7sc","updated":"20260202164601"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-dnl9wtb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-dnl9wtb","updated":"20260202164601"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这就得到了两个二维的特征图："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"F_{avg}^s "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":" F_{max}^s"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(大小都是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"1 \\times H \\times W"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​)。"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-l6z367y","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-l6z367y","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-7l1ggn8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-7l1ggn8","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通道拼接concat。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-o3v0itb","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-o3v0itb","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-uxekoy5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-uxekoy5","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷积提取： 使用一个 7 "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times 7 的卷积核对拼接后的图进行卷积操作。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-hwcsyce","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-hwcsyce","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260202164423-3ggeaia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-3ggeaia","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"经过sigmoid函数归一化后和原始输入相乘。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-klj13w0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-klj13w0","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260114210309726"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/3693258/202601/3693258-20260114210317343-1642602464.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-rasuuor","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-rasuuor","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.3.一些小问题"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-5uqk4kc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-5uqk4kc","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么通道注意力是使用直接相加的方式进行特征融合而空间注意力却是使用concat叠加的方式进行特征融合?"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-wjd3s40","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-wjd3s40","updated":"20260202164607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.CBAM结构框图和代码展示"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-9yowbxx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-9yowbxx","updated":"20260202164607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.2.代码展示"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-x6mudzj","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-x6mudzj","updated":"20260202164607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"cHl0aG9u"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":" import torch \n import torch.nn as nn\n import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n import torch.nn.functional as F\n import torch.optim as optim\n from torchvision import datasets, transforms\n from torch.utils.data import DataLoader\n import numpy as np\n ​\n class CBAMBlock(nn.Module):\n     '''CBAM注意力机制模块\n         包含通道注意力机制模块以及空间注意力机制模块\n         Args:\n             outchannels: 输入特征图的通道数\n             reduction: 通道注意力机制模块中全连接层的缩减比例\n     '''\n     def __init__(self , outchannels , reduction = 4):\n         super(CBAMBlock , self).__init__()\n         # 通道注意力机制模块 channel attention module\n         self.maxpool = nn.AdaptiveMaxPool2d(1)\n         self.avgpool = nn.AdaptiveAvgPool2d(1)\n         self.fc1 = nn.Linear(outchannels , outchannels // reduction , bias = False)\n         self.relu = nn.ReLU()\n         self.fc2 = nn.Linear(outchannels // reduction , outchannels , bias = False)\n         self.sigmoid = nn.Sigmoid()\n ​\n         # 空间注意力机制模块 spatial attention module\n         self.conv = nn.Conv2d(in_channels=2 , out_channels = 1 , kernel_size = 7 , stride = 1 , padding = 3 , bias = False)\n ​\n     def forward(self , x):\n         '''\n             前向传播函数\n             1. 通道注意力机制模块\n                 a. 分别进行最大池化以及平均池化\n                 b. 通过全连接层进行特征提取(分别)\n                 c. 将两个特征直接相加，然后sigmoid归一化\n             2. 空间注意力机制模块\n                 a. 对通道注意力机制模块的输出进行最大池化以及平均池化\n                 b. 将两个池化结果在通道维度上进行拼接\n                 c. 通过卷积层进行特征提取，然后sigmoid归一化\n         '''\n         # 通道注意力机制模块\n         maxpool_out = self.maxpool(x)\n         avgpool_out = self.avgpool(x)\n ​\n         maxpool_out = maxpool_out.view(-1 , x.size(1)) \n         avgpool_out = avgpool_out.view(-1 , x.size(1))\n ​\n         F_max = self.fc2(self.relu(self.fc1(maxpool_out)))       \n         F_avg = self.fc2(self.relu(self.fc1(avgpool_out)))\n ​\n         channel_attention_out = self.sigmoid(F_max+F_avg).unsqueeze(2).unsqueeze(3)  # [B , C , 1 , 1] , add操作\n         F_1 = channel_attention_out * x\n ​\n         # 空间注意力机制模块\n         spatial_maxpool , _ = torch.max(F_1 , dim=1 , keepdim = True)                       # [B , 1 , H , W]\n         spatial_avgpool = torch.mean(F_1 , dim=1 , keepdim = True)                          # [B , 1 , H , W]\n         spatial_attention_out = torch.cat([spatial_maxpool , spatial_avgpool] , dim = 1)    # [B , 2 , H , W] , concat操作\n         spatial_attention_out = self.sigmoid(self.conv(spatial_attention_out))              # [B , 1 , H , W]\n         F_2 = spatial_attention_out * F_1\n ​\n         return F_2\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260202164423-s2xk2c2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260202164423-s2xk2c2","updated":"20260202164423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260202164423-vbdvjsk.svg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]}